{"id":"35d9995cab826390c36af63405e48838e1a266e1","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1243633","title":"突然想到 AI 一个很可怕的点，以后会没有程序员了，而这是我们自己造成的！","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"meetyuan","excerpt":"职场话题 - @meetyuan - AI 已经从互联网上学会了绝大部分编程的知识，已经革了很多程序员的命了几乎所有的 AI 都在学习我们开发项目的提示词，终有一天它全学会了，那时候我们连提示词都没机会输入了，还需要程序员吗？","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Wrapper\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>AI 已经从互联网上学会了绝大部分编程的知识，已经革了很多程序员的命了</p>\n<p>几乎所有的 AI 都在学习我们开发项目的提示词，终有一天它全学会了，那时候我们连提示词都没机会输入了，还需要程序员吗？ </p>\n<p>现在的情况就是，我知道你在学我，也知道你学会了就会抛弃我，但是我还是在给你学，等着你来革我的命！</p>\n</div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/AI\"><li></li> AI</a><a href=\"/tag/程序员\"><li></li> 程序员</a><a href=\"/tag/革新\"><li></li> 革新</a></P><p><span>83 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-09-22 12:08:05 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18110203\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6227755426b43a6fd7315b0fd14db6e9?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"moooooooo\" data-uid=\"33358\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/moooooooo\">moooooooo</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 14:28:59 +08:00\">21h 54m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>以前会开车的都会修车,现在呢.一个道理,以后写代码这件事不是每个科技公司必备的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18110223\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6c2b/646b/621283_normal.png?m=1692511549\" alt=\"gpt5\" data-uid=\"621283\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/gpt5\">gpt5</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 14:32:29 +08:00\">21h 50m ago via iPad</span> \n                    \n                    <p>是数学家科学家造成的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18110289\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9808/e077/158096_normal.png?m=1764929411\" alt=\"luzemin\" data-uid=\"158096\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/luzemin\">luzemin</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 14:42:32 +08:00\">21h 40m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>表面上是我们自我革命，其实是每个人被推着没得选</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18110310\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/cf32/e5db/185755_normal.png?m=1740120653\" alt=\"vone\" data-uid=\"185755\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/vone\">vone</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 14:45:02 +08:00\">21h 38m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我去，不早说。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18110315\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/51f3/a1b8/290883_normal.png?m=1768442184\" alt=\"meetyuan\" data-uid=\"290883\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/meetyuan\">meetyuan</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 14:45:39 +08:00\">21h 37m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/94\">94</a> 太长了，我没看，我打算让 AI 帮我看一下</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18110329\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/27f22d10f884ff4808dfac005ef5377b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"lyxeno\" data-uid=\"449913\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/lyxeno\">lyxeno</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 14:47:16 +08:00\">21h 36m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>进步了。以前还有马车车夫，现在也没了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18110335\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/cdca/41db/41900_normal.png?m=1711607036\" alt=\"icanfork\" data-uid=\"41900\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/icanfork\">icanfork</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 14:47:54 +08:00\">21h 35m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>以前的 github 开源，社区共建，没有想到是一步一步的杀死自己（的职业）</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18110341\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/51f3/a1b8/290883_normal.png?m=1768442184\" alt=\"meetyuan\" data-uid=\"290883\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/meetyuan\">meetyuan</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 14:48:19 +08:00\">21h 34m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/vone\">vone</a> 刚想到这不就说了，我发现 v2 还没有人讨论这个，应该早有人想到了，但是没说出来</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18110363\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/69a866da93c1737553d2c2ce41cb078b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"BestPix\" data-uid=\"582278\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/BestPix\">BestPix</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 14:52:37 +08:00\">21h 30m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>自动驾驶还革司机的命呢。这个世界又不是没用的人马上就要四</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18110415\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/51f3/a1b8/290883_normal.png?m=1768442184\" alt=\"meetyuan\" data-uid=\"290883\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/meetyuan\">meetyuan</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 15:01:11 +08:00\">21h 22m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/BestPix\">BestPix</a> 不至于死，但是现在吉祥三宝(网约车，外卖，快递)已经满额了，后面工作机会只会越来越少了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18110524\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/9c030a75f5bfb183a5a089d58726da63?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"askalau\" data-uid=\"819028\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/askalau\">askalau</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 15:14:48 +08:00\">21h 8m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>程序员职业没了 还会有新的职业出现 乐观一点吧</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18110624\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/dbd3/6c22/210254_normal.png?m=1715407255\" alt=\"8355\" data-uid=\"210254\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/8355\">8355</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 15:31:33 +08:00\">20h 51m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>真到这个时候还有什么职业是存在的呢? 体力劳动 AI 驱动机器人,脑力劳动 AI 驱动算力.</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18110692\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/4db7cab0a7ee94c2cb26a058aece998e?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"izzzz\" data-uid=\"775880\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/izzzz\">izzzz</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 15:40:07 +08:00\">20h 43m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>这问题不是从 Claude4.6 出来的时候就开始讨论了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18110705\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/520bf06680aa35444fa23688bea4bc1c?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"yiitree\" data-uid=\"557785\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>18</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yiitree\">yiitree</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 15:41:52 +08:00\">20h 41m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 2</span>\n                    \n                    <p>前段时间数学家还天天叫着抵制 ai ，程序员早就被革的不说话了。没人知道后面咋发展，虽然一个个都说肯定还有其他新岗位出现，但是这次代替明显是全方位的，不是纺织机代替纺织工，现在是代替了很多各种脑力劳动、创造相关的思考岗位，我反正明显感觉思考的越来越少，不会就问 ai</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18110707\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/dbadb148490a8429e86319b4a8bb4ef6?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"NoKey\" data-uid=\"367502\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>19</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/NoKey\">NoKey</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 15:42:22 +08:00\">20h 40m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>马车到汽车的变化，没有这么剧烈，可以理解为马车要一个车夫，汽车要一个司机，最对说，汽车拉的比马车多，马夫可能会短期减少，但是回来运力需求大了，司机需求量也大<br>但是 ai 来说，它不需要司机，无人驾驶，直接不需要司机了<br>它自己能干很多事情，也就不需要固化的软件了<br>它能控制很多机器，工人也就不需要这么多了<br>所以。。。如果 ai 发展缓慢，那么全球人口减少，逐步的可以适应这种变化<br>如果 ai 发展迅速，那完蛋了，资本家绝对不会养一群没用的工人~<br>这个时候，是不是有田的，相对来说更稳一点，不行回家种田，饿不死</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18110744\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a128aefafcc7f3e5fa2b8d9e99c8f7fc?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"artiga033\" data-uid=\"591490\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>21</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/artiga033\">artiga033</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 15:49:01 +08:00\">20h 34m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>社会分工本来就是迟早要消失的，精细的分工严重阻碍了人的全面发展</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18110779\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/57dc/ab19/616082_normal.png?m=1677416854\" alt=\"davidoff567\" data-uid=\"616082\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>22</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/davidoff567\">davidoff567</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 15:53:39 +08:00\">20h 29m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>大家都知道 AI 会消灭 5 个老岗位，再产生 1-2 个新岗位。不过没人能改变趋势，现在全球都没法停下了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18110817\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/94ab/1ca7/143561_normal.png?m=1713477909\" alt=\"carryli\" data-uid=\"143561\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>23</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/carryli\">carryli</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 15:57:32 +08:00\">20h 25m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>说白了， 生产力进步不可能改变生产关系，生产力进度富有的是资本家，<br>我们只能变成社会的弃民，就是废物</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18110818\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/12939beb2e4853e7c0479d8b2e5f3f39?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"V2LIYANG\" data-uid=\"520928\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>24</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/V2LIYANG\">V2LIYANG</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 15:57:39 +08:00\">20h 25m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>演员明星们已经不吱声了，都搁家里歇着了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18110891\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/536d/a34c/516759_normal.png?m=1606181680\" alt=\"TomatoCLI\" data-uid=\"516759\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>27</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/TomatoCLI\">TomatoCLI</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 16:09:56 +08:00\">20h 13m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>目前我全在看到的时候中文圈在说，难道是中文圈的社会分工太过精细导致的？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18110969\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6f912d7ac2fc0aad112b61d4813a96d4?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"yarawen\" data-uid=\"611973\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>28</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yarawen\">yarawen</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 16:23:27 +08:00\">19h 59m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>从去年年底，Opus4.5 上线的时候，我已经 emo 过了，<br>这快一年了，怎么大家才回过味儿来呢</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18110989\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/cb7e/d3ff/714531_normal.png?m=1761119463\" alt=\"V2Try\" data-uid=\"714531\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>29</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/V2Try\">V2Try</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 16:27:05 +08:00\">19h 56m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>这可如何是好，我们是最后一代了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18111012\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/489a/8cb4/462177_normal.png?m=1687746598\" alt=\"BlueBing\" data-uid=\"462177\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>30</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/BlueBing\">BlueBing</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 16:31:29 +08:00\">19h 51m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你可以更信任 ai ，但是我们需要人类兜底和担责。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18111023\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/69c6/27fd/54059_normal.png?m=1389512292\" alt=\"adoal\" data-uid=\"54059\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>32</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/adoal\">adoal</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 16:33:13 +08:00\">19h 50m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/carryli\">carryli</a> 二战之后生产力的发展让人们忘记了阶级叙事，或者说不承认阶级矛盾的尖锐性。实际上古早的阶级斗争实践早就把这些看清楚了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18111057\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/cdfbcecfac10ddbff28d0a8edc3320df?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Razio\" data-uid=\"494931\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>34</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Razio\">Razio</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 16:37:09 +08:00\">19h 46m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>1. 有本事的适应环境，没本事的被环境淘汰<br>2.出了问题怪 AI 还是怪使用 AI 的人</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18111123\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/f5dac702f2936e95d543670f76649f23?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"laminux29\" data-uid=\"381760\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>35</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/laminux29\">laminux29</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 16:45:40 +08:00\">19h 37m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 2</span>\n                    \n                    <div><p>赞同楼上。</p><p>聪明人，换个行业，同样会活的很好。</p><p>而且有 AI 是造福全人类的好事，程序员这个行业没了就没了吧。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18111135\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/0f14ce4075e89bc4db9115530bc480a7?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"jzyyaorenzhen\" data-uid=\"409055\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>36</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jzyyaorenzhen\">jzyyaorenzhen</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 16:47:00 +08:00\">19h 36m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>普通程序员应该会被替代。新的架构或者研发人员不会被替代。模型的知识库也需要更新</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18111151\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/15ab424bfee1bb4c078cd22675f2928e?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"wysnxzm\" data-uid=\"588304\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>38</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/wysnxzm\">wysnxzm</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 16:48:56 +08:00\">19h 34m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>一进来这贴就年轻三岁,真好</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18111303\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f39f/cabd/660117_normal.png?m=1715408332\" alt=\"gloeaerris\" data-uid=\"660117\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>39</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/gloeaerris\">gloeaerris</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 17:16:11 +08:00\">19h 7m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/meetyuan\">meetyuan</a> #8 估计你刚开始用，这个问题网上早就在讨论，都 2026 年了，谁还关心这个问题，早都在关心怎么在 AI 时代找到新位置，太落后了，赶紧追追吧。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18111376\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f39f/cabd/660117_normal.png?m=1715408332\" alt=\"gloeaerris\" data-uid=\"660117\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>41</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/gloeaerris\">gloeaerris</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 17:26:48 +08:00\">18h 56m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>@<a href=\"/member/meetyuan\">meetyuan</a> #26 ber ，gemer ，提示词工程师 prompt engineering 是 2023 年的东西啦，后面依次是 context engineering 、harness engineering ，现在是 loop engineering ，你不会不知道吧，早都该想到的东西，都在调侃你呢 <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/NIvxivj.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NIvxivj.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p><p>别说程序员了，很多非体力劳动的岗位也就是脑力劳动都可能会消失，甚至包括科学家、数学家等，但是旧的岗位消失就会有新的岗位诞生，只不过新的岗位会更少，需要的人才也更少，竞争会更激烈。</p><p>你以为体力劳动就没法被取代吗？体力劳动将来必然会被具身智能取代一大部分。工业革命整个进程都是用机械代替体力劳动并提高效率，信息革命是要把体力和脑力一起替代，绝望不？</p><p>发展就是这样</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18111385\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9e38/0cf2/413420_normal.png?m=1789083210\" alt=\"413420\" data-uid=\"413420\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>42</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/413420\">413420</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 17:28:25 +08:00\">18h 54m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>这都是自然进程的一部分</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18111488\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/12f3/cb07/512134_normal.png?m=1602416339\" alt=\"debugtheworld\" data-uid=\"512134\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>43</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/debugtheworld\">debugtheworld</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 17:44:16 +08:00\">18h 39m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>没有程序员总会有别的职业的。程序员本身也只是时代发展出来的一个职业而已。这个职业放以前可能是打更人、可能是马车车夫、可能是割麦人。所以在此感叹在时代面前，独立人的力量太小了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18111523\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e125/f95f/500267_normal.png?m=1782294866\" alt=\"LabJo\" data-uid=\"500267\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>44</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/LabJo\">LabJo</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 17:52:15 +08:00\">18h 31m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>没有程序员是小事儿，以后要是 tmd 没有科学家了怎么办啊</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18111664\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/07c9/d6c7/439711_normal.png?m=1789631674\" alt=\"QingXuJiaZhi\" data-uid=\"439711\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>46</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/QingXuJiaZhi\">QingXuJiaZhi</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 18:32:30 +08:00\">17h 50m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>工作岗位可能变少，但生产力提高了，社会的总财富就会增加，货币也必然需要增发。</p><p>那么，增发的货币会流去哪里呢？</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18111692\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/d1e5d66e40eca2eb8f0782171a1dae50?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"jasonchen168\" data-uid=\"203505\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>47</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jasonchen168\">jasonchen168</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 18:42:10 +08:00\">17h 41m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>这个变革过程太快，对程序员太不友好了，没有办法，跟上节奏，学会用 ai</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18111716\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/11822edc4b3c35c89dfd3b833f45b426?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"foryou2023\" data-uid=\"626307\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>50</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/foryou2023\">foryou2023</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 18:53:21 +08:00\">17h 29m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>时代的发展罢了，在程序员之前还有那么多岗位消失了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18111730\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/11822edc4b3c35c89dfd3b833f45b426?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"foryou2023\" data-uid=\"626307\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>51</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/foryou2023\">foryou2023</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 19:00:46 +08:00\">17h 22m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>@<a href=\"/member/loryyang\">loryyang</a> 如果 10 年前学习理财的话，这些年多少应该会有一些进步，不过也不能保证能挣钱。个人差不多就是 17 年的时候开始学习炒股的，目前也是勉强能活着不怎么亏钱。</p><p>个人一直认为投资是非常值得投入时间和精力学习的，因为一旦成功，未来的下半辈子就可以靠这个吃饭了。</p><p>不过很多人会在学成之前亏光了自己所有的本金，也有人也就不适合走这条路。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18111768\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/803f/25db/109311_normal.png?m=1755309123\" alt=\"VeteranCat\" data-uid=\"109311\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>53</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/VeteranCat\">VeteranCat</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 19:14:55 +08:00\">17h 8m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>有没有一种可能，程序员资格在软考里面是初级考试。 你要做的是软件设计师，乃至架构师。 打算向这个基于 Transformer 架构的，凭借大算力才跑出强大的模型投降？ 你要学会驾驭它，速胜论和速败论都是不可取的。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18111820\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/13e8/ea90/69701_normal.png?m=1443265551\" alt=\"watzds\" data-uid=\"69701\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>55</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/watzds\">watzds</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 19:44:56 +08:00\">16h 38m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>拒绝 AI ，人人有责</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18111828\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3f06/6f8f/401678_normal.png?m=1770468392\" alt=\"levelworm\" data-uid=\"401678\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>56</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/levelworm\">levelworm</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 19:47:36 +08:00\">16h 35m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>大佬你这是从树洞回来的啊，说了起码一两年了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18111930\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4dfa/8c1c/38436_normal.png?m=1789163514\" alt=\"msg7086\" data-uid=\"38436\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>57</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/msg7086\">msg7086</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 20:32:45 +08:00\">15h 50m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>不知道别的公司咋样，我司是早就没有程序员了，招进来的人硕士起步，人人都是软件工程师起，只会写程序的基本进不来。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18112005\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2124c8aba1b20643d71a5101a519a80d?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"zerovoid\" data-uid=\"263784\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>59</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zerovoid\">zerovoid</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 21:10:46 +08:00\">15h 12m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>这是好事啊，<br>消灭一些旧的岗位，才会诞生新的岗位，<br>至于新的岗位是什么，还得大家摸索一下。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18112029\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/09f5/1d35/94673_normal.png?m=1786686047\" alt=\"exiaoxing\" data-uid=\"94673\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>60</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/exiaoxing\">exiaoxing</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 21:23:08 +08:00\">15h 0m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>即使有新岗位也是寥寥无几，跟替代的岗位比都不是一个量级的<br>这次革命跟之前的任何一次革命都不一样</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18112040\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/e4bc80cdb035fff05057d0a8c400d968?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"democrazyx\" data-uid=\"582142\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>61</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/democrazyx\">democrazyx</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 21:27:12 +08:00\">14h 56m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>很正常，这是社会发展的必经之路，效率的提高必然会导致人才供给过剩，但解放出来的生产力往往会催生出其他工作。只不过从历史来看，被消灭的旧工作和新技术催生的新工作的对人才的需求并不重叠，甚至不会出现在同一个时代。<br>天地不仁，以万物为刍狗。历史的车轮滚滚向前，不要妄想会因为你失业就停下。<br>最好的办法就是赶紧跳开，而是主动换个赛道，不要等车轮碾过来了才惊觉为时已晚。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18112220\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b9c7/2bd6/240871_normal.png?m=1789866502\" alt=\"zackkk\" data-uid=\"240871\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>62</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zackkk\">zackkk</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 22:58:31 +08:00\">13h 24m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>未来软件价格会下降，程序员技能和扫地技能差不多，程序员只是主要工作的一小部分，主业 6 小时扫大街，2 小时回办公室维护扫大街的后台</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18112244\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/15c0/8959/38523_normal.png?m=1783066438\" alt=\"konakona\" data-uid=\"38523\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>63</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/konakona\">konakona</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 23:13:23 +08:00\">13h 9m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>好好检讨一下为什么是现在才知道，而不是去年底就知道。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18112478\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b882/c1a4/574181_normal.png?m=1736555839\" alt=\"neco14\" data-uid=\"574181\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>64</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/neco14\">neco14</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-22 08:18:09 +08:00\">4h 5m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>可能就不需要每天上班</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18112530\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/51f3/a1b8/290883_normal.png?m=1768442184\" alt=\"meetyuan\" data-uid=\"290883\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>65</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/meetyuan\">meetyuan</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-22 08:35:11 +08:00\">3h 48m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/awalkingman\">awalkingman</a> 我就发个感概什么的，怎么你了？ V2 上有争论很正常吧，就你他妈的跟狗皮膏药一样，天天恶心人，甩都甩不掉，太倒霉了！</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18112719\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/bd5f/e720/445325_normal.png?m=1785727425\" alt=\"wuxinling\" data-uid=\"445325\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>66</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/wuxinling\">wuxinling</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-22 09:09:34 +08:00\">3h 13m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>只能转产品了，以后考虑的是这个需求需要一个什么样的产品</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18112734\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7c85/57ec/188138_normal.png?m=1514209605\" alt=\"me007\" data-uid=\"188138\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>67</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/me007\">me007</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-22 09:12:03 +08:00\">3h 11m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>现在没有“钻木取火岗”了啊。 科学发展的悲剧...</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18113013\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f84a/39bd/329667_normal.png?m=1770729345\" alt=\"zhouweiluan\" data-uid=\"329667\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>69</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zhouweiluan\">zhouweiluan</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-22 09:42:06 +08:00\">2h 41m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>必然的了，我都不是程序员只是个设计师现在都能随便开发一个软件了😂</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18113221\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/0d37ef11dd0651f4ae8895d1ea0a2f80?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"cshwen\" data-uid=\"72688\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>72</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/cshwen\">cshwen</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-22 10:02:44 +08:00\">2h 20m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>“我们”不背锅，你这说法不就跟富人浪费水资源，怪穷人头上来，是一样的谬论吗</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18113262\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f2c9/f943/219598_normal.png?m=1516931274\" alt=\"daye\" data-uid=\"219598\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>74</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/daye\">daye</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-22 10:06:35 +08:00\">2h 16m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>适者生存，不适者休息</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18113376\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b612/1869/13387_normal.png?m=1344084588\" alt=\"shanks\" data-uid=\"13387\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>75</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/shanks\">shanks</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-22 10:18:30 +08:00\">2h 4m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>AI 无法担责，还是得人来 review ，除了问题人背锅。难道你说线上故障把这个 AI 换掉？而且现在 AI 生成的速度越来越快，人可能都看不过来了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18113423\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/51f3/a1b8/290883_normal.png?m=1768442184\" alt=\"meetyuan\" data-uid=\"290883\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>77</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/meetyuan\">meetyuan</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-22 10:21:59 +08:00\">2h 1m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/shanks\">shanks</a> 既然要人来 review,那么可以学习你 review 后怎么修改的代码，然后继续套娃学习</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18113461\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/1de4265471582607d796903997063772?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"wu00\" data-uid=\"568801\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>78</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/wu00\">wu00</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-22 10:25:44 +08:00\">1h 57m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>AI 左脚踩右脚螺旋升天，产值暴增 <br>全员下岗，躺平等政府发钱，提前进入下一个社会体制 <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/6DMydmQ.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6DMydmQ.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18113937\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1e4b/ca0f/458388_normal.png?m=1781244711\" alt=\"jiaomeng\" data-uid=\"458388\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>81</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jiaomeng\">jiaomeng</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-22 11:17:26 +08:00\">1h 5m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>AI 是放大器，我们现有的科技即使有 核聚变，无穷尽的能量，也调度不起来。 大家以后各自玩自己的星球呗。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18114298\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2d65b56e42a49c3e46cd5a1b580703de?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"horizon\" data-uid=\"14474\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>82</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/horizon\">horizon</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-22 12:01:40 +08:00\">21 mins ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/gpt5\">gpt5</a> #3 <br>并不，没有互联网上公开的数据，LLM 也训不出来</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"AI 已经从互联网上学会了绝大部分编程的知识，已经革了很多程序员的命了 几乎所有的 AI 都在学习我们开发项目的提示词，终有一天它全学会了，那时候我们连提示词都没机会输入了，还需要程序员吗？ 现在的情况就是，我知道你在学我，也知道你学会了就会抛弃我，但是我还是在给你学，等着你来革我的命！ AI 程序员 革新83 replies • 2026-09-22 12:08:05 +08:00 2 moooooooo 21h 54m ago 以前会开车的都会修车,现在呢.一个道理,以后写代码这件事不是每个科技公司必备的 3 gpt5 21h 50m ago via iPad 是数学家科学家造成的 5 luzemin 21h 40m ago 表面上是我们自我革命，其实是每个人被推着没得选 6 vone 21h 38m ago 我去，不早说。 7 meetyuan OP 21h 37m ago @94 太长了，我没看，我打算让 A